window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The complete series in a single offering!</b></p> <p><b>I found paradise, and now I must save it.</b></p> <p>Life has a funny way of throwing a wrench in the spokes. One day I was about to take my hot coworker out to lunch, and suddenly I was struck by lightning and transported to a different world. Crazy how that works.</p> <p>Once I got over my initial shock, I realized that this place was absolutely incredible. Furthermore, all of the adult men were killed in battle just over a year ago. Yes, I was the only guy in town. Destiny’s hero, right?</p> <p>Wrong. Turns out I wasn’t the hero they wanted and prayed for. A magical spell went awry and they got me instead. Well, considering they wanted me to help repopulate, I was going to work my absolute hardest to find a bit of heroism within myself and make it happen, even that just meant winning some battles between the sheets.</p> <p>Oh, but there’s also an undead prince that wants everyone dead. Can’t forget about that, as it’s part of my deal. Looks like I'd better figure out how to be a hero real fast.</p>"; 
